#
# Helper script, run in the background by the ANF job processor. It makes sure
# the isolated "inet fastpath" table exists once the (WAN) devices configured in
# firewall.conf are available. It is safe to run repeatedly: the table is only
# (re)built while it is absent.
#
# Target hardware: PC Engines APU2 (see 70fastpath.plugin).
#
